{"id":"krueger-q56","title":"Elm/Elmish parser initiative: tokenizer, parser, AST, CST, visitors, WASM, CLI","description":"Elm/Elmish parser initiative for moonrockz/krueger. Scope: Tokenizer/lexer (bobzhang/lexer or custom). Parser (grammar to AST/CST). AST and CST types. Visitors: DOM, accept-visitor, fold, push-based SAX, pull-based cursor. WASM core + Component Model. CLI with clap (tokenize, lex subcommands). TDD; design phase produces design doc, BDD scenarios (Gherkin), test strategy (whitebox, blackbox, e2e for CLI and WASM).","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"epic","owner":"957246+DamianReeves@users.noreply.github.com","created_at":"2026-02-24T23:37:29Z","created_by":"Damian Reeves","updated_at":"2026-02-24T23:37:29Z","labels":["elm","epic","parser"]}
{"id":"krueger-q56.1","title":"Design phase: design doc, BDD scenarios (Gherkin), test strategy","description":"Design phase for Elm/Elmish parser initiative. Deliverables: (1) Design doc in docs/plans/ with architecture, visitor model, WASM, CLI. (2) Test strategy documenting whitebox (_wbtest.mbt), blackbox (_test.mbt), BDD (Gherkin .feature), e2e for CLI and WASM; TDD for all stories. Test artifacts grow with each implementation issue — we do not create all BDD/whitebox/blackbox/e2e tests up front. This task blocks all implementation tasks.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"957246+DamianReeves@users.noreply.github.com","created_at":"2026-02-24T23:37:45Z","created_by":"Damian Reeves","updated_at":"2026-02-24T23:56:41Z","labels":["design","testing"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"krueger-q56.1","depends_on_id":"krueger-q56","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-24T17:37:44Z","created_by":"Damian Reeves","metadata":"{}"}]}
